                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "PooShooter : Toilet Invaders is a modern masterpiece, a game to rival any Mario, Master chief or Msconic title. It's epic story spanning all 13 continents and 52 seas will bring tears to the eyes of jaded war veterans and make even the greatest philisophical mind re-evaluate all that they believe. This game has revolutionised my life. It gave me the worldview I needed to get that promotion to the manager at my local Mcdonalds, made me a devout athiest. I so intellectually outpaced my wife that my marriage has fallen apart over my spending 18 hours a day on PooShooter: Toilet Invaders(Have no fear for I can simply outwit the judge at the divource hearing with my intellect gained from PooShooter: Toilet Invaders). My intake of goodboy points has increased dramatically, chicken tendies practically flow through my house like a river thanks to the life advice from PooShooter: Toilet Invaders. I have many framed screenshots, for the graphics of PooShooter: Toilet Invaders is superior to any Davinci or Picasso works, which seem as mere childrens scrawls in comparison to the epic vistas of this game. To even call it a game is an insult, as it trancends anything of this puny art form, and becomes and experience, nay, a religion.",
